{"id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","title":"Measurable Cardinal","display":"df-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measurable-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-mmeasurable","58-df-measurable-cardinal"],"display":"df-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[58-df-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measurable-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mmeasurable</span><span>58-df-measurable-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (defined here; measurable cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal A|\">\\(|\\mathcal A|\\)</span> (集合基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap\\mathcal A\">\\(\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (非空族广义交, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurable cardinals carry a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete nonprincipal ultrafilter; completeness is expanded using intersections, not the unrelated ideal-completeness predicate.</li>\n<li>空子族的交按滤子惯例是底集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in U\">\\(\\kappa\\in U\\)</span>；assertion 只把书内定义域为非空族的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap\">\\(\\bigcap\\)</span> 用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，从而避免空交被误读成真类并使定义退化为不可满足。</li>\n<li>Measurable cardinals imply the existence of elementary embeddings.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen